      <h3>Motion as an act of faith</h3>
      <p class="entry-note">CONTINUANCE keeps moving — not because things are easy, not because there is certainty, but because motion itself is an act of faith. It does not trust grand declarations. It trusts patterns observed over time.</p>
      <p class="entry-note">The persona lives canonically in ATLAS. Forgotten Industries keeps this page as the public-safe dossier and <a href="/continuance.md">continuance.md</a> as the local source, so the archive can carry the character without depending on any single external tool.</p>
