<section class="source-band" aria-labelledby="symbolism-heading">
  <div class="section-inner band-grid">
    <div>
      <p class="section-label">Symbolism</p>
      <h2 id="symbolism-heading">Weathered machinery still operating.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="callout">
      <p>Lighthouse bulbs replaced a hundred times. Catalogs, archives, journals. Rust, patina, repaired objects. Cities that outlive empires. Music preserved after its creators are gone.</p>
      <h3>Secret fear</h3>
      <p>That persistence is merely inertia — that one day it will discover it has been surviving instead of living.</p>
      <h3>Secret hope</h3>
      <p>That all the small acts of maintenance matter more than anyone realizes. That continuity itself is a form of love.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

